{"id":"G1124","lemma":"γραφή","transliteration":"graphē","sayIt":"graphē","language":"Greek","partOfSpeech":"noun, feminine","gloss":"a writing","meaning":"γραφή, -ῆς, ἡ\n(γράφω), [in LXX chiefly for כְּתָב ;]\n1. a drawing, painting.\n2.\n(a) writing;\n(b) that which is written, a writing: πᾶσα γ., 2Ti.3:16; γ. ἅγιαι, Rom.1:2; προφητικαί, Rom.16:26; al αἱ γ. τ. προφητῶν, Mat.26:56; ἡ γ., αἱ γ., the sacred writings, the Scriptures (i.e. the OT; see Milligan, NTD, 205); in pl., when the sacred writings as a whole are meant, e.g. Mat.21:42 26:54, Jhn.5:39, Rom.15:4; in sing., when a particular passage is referred to, as in Luk.4:21, Jhn.19:24, Rom.4:3 9:17 10:11 11:2, Jas.2:23 (Cremer, 165; DCG, ii, 584).\n(AS)","glosses":["scripture","scriptures","writings","himself","be","scripture pronounces all things"],"count":49,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"mat-21","v":42,"renderings":{"bsb":"Scriptures","kjv":"the scriptures"}},{"chapterId":"mat-22","v":29,"renderings":{"bsb":"Scriptures","kjv":"the scriptures"}},{"chapterId":"mat-26","v":54,"renderings":{"bsb":"Scriptures","kjv":"shall the scriptures"}},{"chapterId":"mat-26","v":56,"renderings":{"bsb":"writings","kjv":"the scriptures"}},{"chapterId":"mrk-12","v":10,"renderings":{"bsb":"Scripture","kjv":"scripture"}},{"chapterId":"mrk-12","v":24,"renderings":{"bsb":"Scriptures","kjv":"the scriptures"}},{"chapterId":"mrk-14","v":49,"renderings":{"bsb":"Scriptures","kjv":"the scriptures"}},{"chapterId":"luk-4","v":21,"renderings":{"bsb":"Scripture","kjv":"scripture"}},{"chapterId":"luk-24","v":27,"renderings":{"bsb":"Himself","kjv":"the scriptures"}},{"chapterId":"luk-24","v":32,"renderings":{"bsb":"Scriptures"}},{"chapterId":"luk-24","v":45,"renderings":{"bsb":"Scriptures"}},{"chapterId":"jhn-2","v":22,"renderings":{"bsb":"Scripture","kjv":"the scripture"}},{"chapterId":"jhn-5","v":39,"renderings":{"bsb":"Scriptures","kjv":"the scriptures"}},{"chapterId":"jhn-7","v":38,"renderings":{"bsb":"Scripture","kjv":"the scripture"}},{"ch